  "details": "It would be nice to have a upgrade to the invite system, mainly making them persistent, let's say\n\nA. You crash joining a invite lobby and now you need to ask for another one\n\nB. You leave a private world to check on someone and then have to request back, but the person you were with is on red orange or asleep\n\nI believe once invited, you should be able to join that instance as long as it's open or you don't get kicked.\n\nAdditionaly replies shouldn't just delete the Invite, like if I say I'll be there in a few minutes, I shouldnt have to request a new one.\n\nFinally, a cooldown would be nice to prevent spam (like 1 invite/request every 15 sec)",
